    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bayudaya kūlīla ng'hūngū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Modekai aho wīdeeba pyī īyo īkahelwa yenīyo, ūtandūla ī shizwalo shakwe, ūzwala magūnīla, wisamagūlīla na mabu. Hūna ūja ū mu nzengo kūnū akūlīlaga ng'hūngū na būpīna būtaale, n'ilaka lya higūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūja ūūkashika a ha mita gwa ha ng'wa ntemi, wikala hanze; nguno ū munhū ūyo azwalile shizwalo sha magūnīla walī atazunīlījiwe ū kwingīla ū mu mita gwa ha ng'wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī mu sī yene shabizaga ūlū shashika ī shilagīlo sha ntemi, a Bayudaya batandūkaga kūlīla ng'hūngū, būyūfunga, na būbiza banhū ba kwikala bakūlījiagwa būpīna dūhū; nīyo bingī babo būyūdīīla balambalalile ha magūnīla na mu mabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Modekai kūlomba būgunanhi bo ng'wa Esita",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngole Esita aho bang'wīla a batūmami bakwe a bakīma, na a basoloolwa, akapīnīhala no; ūntūmīla shizwalo ū Modekai akazwale, agazuule a magūnīla ayo walī azwalile; alīyo ū Modekai atashanukūlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Esita ūng'witana Hasaki, ūmò wa basoloolwa ba ntemi, ūyo walī wasolwa kūyūngunanha; ūnagīla aje akagīsīlīje, amane īyo yankoyaga ū Modekai, na ni nguno kī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Hasaki ūja ū kūlī Modekai, walī mu gwalugwa ya mu nzengo, a ha būtongi bo mita gwa kwingīla ng'wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Modekai ūng'wīla yose īyo yalī yang'wilongela, pye nī hela ījo walī wahaya ū Hamani gīkī akūjitūūla ū mu mfuko gwa ntemi, kūlwa kūkenaagūlwa kwa Bayudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī nyalūba īyo yalī yandīkwa kūlwa kūbakenaagūla a Bayudaya, īyo yalī yasambaajiwa hose pyī ū mu nzengo gwa Susa, ūng'winha aje akang'olekeje ū Esita, ūng'wīla akansomboolele chiza ī mihayo yenīyo. Na gīkī akankomeleje ū Esita aje akibone nū ntemi ang'wikūmbīlīje na kūbalombela a banhū bakwe bachīlwe shigongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hasaki ūja ng'hana ū kūlī Esita, ūūkansomboolela īyo akīhaya ū Modekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Esita ūntūma hangī aje akang'wīle gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A batūmami ba ntemi, na a banhū ba mu sī jose ījo ajisugile ū ntemi, bamanile gīkī munhū ose ose, abize ngosha nūūlū nkīma, ūlū ūja kwibona nū ntemi ū ng'wibīndo lya mu gatī, alīyo atitanilwe, ū ntemi alī na shilagīlo shimò dūhū, ū munhū ng'wenūyo abūlagwe. Gūlīho mhayo gūmò dūhū ūyo gūdūgije kūpīja munhū, ū ntemi ūlū ūng'olota ū munhū ng'wenūyo na nang'ha gwakwe gwa zahabu. Alīyo ī haha jabītaga shikū makūmi adatū ū nene nataalī ū kwitanwa kūja ū kūlī ntemi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Modekai aho wawīlwa ī mihayo ya ng'wa Esita, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbawīla bashoke koi bakang'wīle, “Ūtiganikage gīkī ū bebe īkī ūlī ng'wikūlū lya ntemi h'ūkūpīla bebe iyene dūhū ū mu Bayudaya a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū ūlahuumūle ū ng'wikanza lyenīlī, a Bayudaya bakūpandīka kwifuula na būpīji kūfuma mu nzīla yīngī, alīyo ū bebe nī numba ya ng'wa so mukūyagaala. Ī gīsī nani ūyo amanile, hamo wingīlile ū ng'wikūlū kūlwa nguno y'ikanza gītī lyenīlī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Esita ūbawīla bakang'wīle ū Modekai gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ūkababilinge pye a Bayudaya abo balī mu nzengo gwa Susa, mufunge kūlwa nguno yane. Yaya ū kūlya nūūlū kūng'wa, ikanza lya shikū idatū līīmi na būjikū; nū nene nakūfunga na a batūmami bane a bakīma, gīt'ūmo mulīītīla a bing'we. Ū gwenūyū ūlū gwamala ū kwītwa, nakūja nakamone ū ntemi, nūūlū īkī ī shilagīlo shilemile. Ūlū icha līlīho, yene nakūcha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Modekai ūja ūkīīta ng'hana būlī mhayo ūyo akalagīīlwa na Esita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
